Phase 1D fix v2: NT8 Operation enum + auto-generated block conflict

Two compile blockers from Round 01 errors CSV:

1. CS0117: 'Operation' has no 'Insert' — NT8's Cbi.Operation enum is
   {Add, Update, Remove}, with resets signalled by e.IsReset (not as an
   Operation value). Aligned to NT's own SuperDomColumns example
   (@PullingStacking.cs).

2. CS0102/CS0111/CS0121/CS0229 duplicate-member errors — NT auto-appends
   its own '#region NinjaScript generated code' block when our manual
   version doesn't byte-match what NT expects. File ended up with two
   copies of every cache + factory method. Fix: remove our manual block
   entirely and let NT generate it on first compile inside the editor.

Replikanto CS1705 warnings in the CSV are from a third-party assembly
unrelated to this file; ignored.

